    "detailed_description": "**CURRENTLY WINDOWS ONLY**<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAn average rage deathrun type of game, with a twist. The name is literal: you can only go straight ahead. No turning back; no going sideways; and to rub extra salt in the wound, no checkpoints.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n11 deathrun-like, rage-inducing precision based levels;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMinimalistic but appealing level design and graphics;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnother cool game to your extensive Steam catalogue that you might revisit once in a while.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n**BASIC TROUBLESHOOTING**<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease uninstall and reinstall the game if you are facing a bug at the end of Level 4. Sorry.<br />\r\nIn general, if there\u2019s any issues that return an error along the lines of \u201cmissing executable\u201d, please uninstall and reinstall the game. Sorry, and thank you.",
